      font-size="16px" font-weight="bold">13.142 Novice Cushion Triangle</text>
<text font-family="sans-serif" font-size="14px" fill="black" x="230" y="248">by Rolbert W. Strickland</text>
<text font-family="sans-serif" font-size="14px" fill="black" x="230" y="266">Facet Talk, Jan/Feb 1999, pg 22</text>
<text font-family="sans-serif" font-size="14px" fill="black" x="230" y="284"> </text>
<text font-family="sans-serif" font-size="14px" fill="black"><tspan x="230" y="302">Angles for R.I. = 1.540</tspan>
